<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
    <!--
        A few example searches, built in Python rather than written out here so
        the method can guard itself: it does nothing once a single real search
        has been counted, and a shop with traffic never finds examples mixed
        into its own demand list.

        Safe to invent, unlike anything on the payments or wallet screens -
        these are counts of searches, not money and not a claim about a named
        customer. One of them found nothing on purpose, because that row is the
        reason the screen exists.

        Not noupdate, for the reason mart369_cart's deal demo gives: with it the
        function would only ever run on a fresh install, and a shop upgrading
        into this feature would never see the examples.
    -->
    <data>
        <function model="mart369.search.term" name="_mart369_load_demo"/>
    </data>
</odoo>
